nt\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115200.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115200-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115200-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115200-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115556-1.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5278\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5278\" class=\"wp-image-5278\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115556-1.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115556-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115556-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115556-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120626.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5280\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5280\" class=\"wp-image-5280\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120626.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120626-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120626-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120626-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"304\" height=\"540\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120632.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5281\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5281\" class=\"wp-image-5281\"\/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135941.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5282\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5282\" class=\"wp-image-5282\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135941.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135941-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135941-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135941-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135942.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5283\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5283\" class=\"wp-image-5283\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135942.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135942-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135942-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_135942-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-background has-light-green-cyan-background-color\">One of the really cool things we found before heading out on our trip was an app called &#8220;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.visittucson.org\/things-to-do\/outdoor-adventure\/mtlemmonsciencetour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Mt. Lemon Science Tour (opens in a new tab)\">Mt. Lemon Science Tour<\/a>&#8220;.  This app can be downloaded from your device app store (free) and it is an approximately 1 hour narrated tour of the ride to the top.  It tells you when to pull over, pause the app and goes on to explain what you&#8217;re looking at!  It&#8217;s a really great idea &#8230; but we ended up having too much fun talking about what we&#8217;ve all been up to since the last time we were together.  Kathy and I decided we&#8217;ll go back up sometime and use the app to learn more about what we&#8217;re seeing.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>As we pulled over at one of the larger roadside parking areas we noticed about a half dozen U.S. Border Patrol vehicles.  It seemed odd that they would be chasing after some bad guys all the way up here.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120149.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5287\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120149.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120149-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120149-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120149-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption>The parking area with Border Patrol vehicles<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>But as we moved closer to the overlook at the wall we could then see what all the activity was about.  They were practicing their rescue techniques having installed hardware to perform a repelling operation.  They actually had one of their members in a basket and were preparing to lower him over the edge into about a 100 foot drop to safety.  We stayed and watched a while before we moved on.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115814.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5288\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5288\" class=\"wp-image-5288\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115814.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115814-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115814-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115814-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115820.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5289\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5289\" class=\"wp-image-5289\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115820.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115820-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115820-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115820-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115849.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5290\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5290\" class=\"wp-image-5290\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115849.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115849-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115849-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_115849-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120307-1.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5291\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5291\" class=\"wp-image-5291\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120307-1.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120307-1-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120307-1-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120307-1-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120417.jpg?fit=700%2C394&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"5292\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=5292\" class=\"wp-image-5292\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120417.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120417-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120417-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/20181211_120417-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-youtube wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Border Patrol Practicing Rescue on Mt. Lemmon Part 1\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/Liw8mzXVOBw?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><figcaption>This first video shows them getting ready to drop him over the edge &#8211; head first!<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed-youtube wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Border Patrol Practicing Rescue on Mt. Lemmon Part 2\" width=\"685\" height=\"385\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/STJu6SjMJ0g?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n<\/div><figcaption>Part 2 video of the repelling operation &#8211; he&#8217;s about halfway down the cliff<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>All in all, it was another beautiful day in paradise and it was especially great that we were able to share it with two of our full-time RV buddies Rob and Michelle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We look forward to maybe hooking up with Rob &amp; Michelle (and many others) when we&#8217;re at the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.quartzsitervshow.com\/\">Big Tent RV Show in Quartzite<\/a> the last week of January.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Thanks for coming along and be sure to sign up to get our future blog posts automatically by entering your email address in the little box on the left side where it says &#8220;Sign Up To Follow Our Blog&#8221;.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can check out all our RV full-time travel videos at herbnkathyrv on You Tube and click SUBSCRIBE down in the lower right corner of any of our videos.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We met Rob &amp; Michelle when we were working up in Michigan last summer at Pere Marquette Oaks RV Park. They were pretty new to the full-time RV lifestyle themselves having retired from work, selling their home and buying the truck and the 5th wheel to live in as they traveled the country. We were &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2019\/01\/01\/another-great-climb-er-drive-up-the-mountain\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Another Great  Climb .. er, Drive up the Mountain<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[677,264,19546,554707329],"tags":[24592,554707659,554707663,554707664,554707666,554707231,554707241,554707661,554707660,554707655,554707657,554707658,554707665,554707662,554707656],"class_list":["post-5235","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-friends","category-learning","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-arizona","tag-border-patrol","tag-catalina","tag-coronado-national-forest","tag-driving-tour","tag-friends","tag-herbnkathy-com","tag-herbnkathyrv","tag-herbsells","tag-mt-lemmon","tag-repel","tag-rescue","tag-science-tour","tag-sightseeing","tag-tucson"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5235","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"ht